hroughout by only checking and calling. This passive behavior typically indicates a medium-strength hand like a pair of Aces or Queens, rather than a full house (which would likely have raised at some point). Given that I'm behind overall and need to accumulate chips, I should extract value from this strong hand. A bet of 300-400 chips represents a solid value bet that can get called by weaker hands while not overcommitting if I'm somehow beaten. Checking would miss an opportunity to build my stack.\n\nAnswer: 300"}
