ious streets, I should at least call. The bet is small relative to the pot and my stack. However, raising could be profitable if they have a hand like Kings or 10s that they might call with. A raise to 448-600 chips could extract value from weaker hands while not committing too much if they have a monster. \n\nThat said, the appearance of the third 7 on the river is suspicious timing for their bet. If they also have a 7, we're in a kicker battle. Still, the pot odds and my hand strength justify aggression here. I'll raise to apply pressure and extract value.\n\nAnswer: 500"}
